      "updated": 1751133224220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Hot keys can be a issue for\n  celebrity posts\n  -- Brute force: scale up\n  -- Two-levels of cache\n  -- Multiple Nodes\n\n--------\n  -- CDN? Updates? :/\n  -- Pool of partition keys?\n\n** Prefer: Two level-cache thus\n             one node.\n            \n    Con: Becomes requirement for multiple capabilities\n           (e.g. Search & Feed Gen)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Hot keys can be a issue for\n  celebrity posts\n  -- Brute force: scale up\n  -- Two-levels of cache\n  -- Multiple Nodes\n\n--------\n  -- CDN? Updates? :/\n  -- Pool of partition keys?\n\n** Prefer: Two level-cache thus\n             one node.\n            \n    Con: Becomes requirement for multiple capabilities\n           (e.g. Search & Feed Gen)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
